5:["$","$L1b",null,{"data":{"seo":{"description":"Artificial intelligence to protect our democracies.","ogImage":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-968ae8c9c60234920e0c2ae5aa471fee74e7fba6-1200x660-png","_type":"reference"}},"title":"HX-2 â€“ AI Strike Drone"},"slide1":{"bgImageLandscape":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-168bdf64b3578f71ae241b9e8bf8d0dec7ce5c5d-2880x1800-png","_type":"reference"}},"bgImagePortrait":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-07705a34ae13558b42b3767f3f0532d079a46190-780x1688-png","_type":"reference"}},"text1":"HX-2 â€“\nAI Strike Drone"},"slide10":{"cta1Text":[{"_key":"de","_type":"internationalizedArrayStringValue","value":"Mehr zum Thema Ethik bei Helsing"},{"_key":"en","_type":"internationalizedArrayStringValue","value":"Read more about ethics at Helsing"},{"_key":"fr","_type":"internationalizedArrayStringValue","value":"Pour en savoir plus sur les principes Ã©thiques dâ€™Helsing"}],"ctaText1":"Read more about ethics at Helsing","image1":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-4ade0ce21160ee0f53353000c2fa9e9072b1df82-800x1004-png","_type":"reference"}},"image2":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-756cce939f633bb04cefe07a085b5a5fdacae729-200x251-png","_type":"reference"}},"image3":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-88493083af8f6c15cb12cb20f64a306991baa756-800x1004-png","_type":"reference"}},"image4":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-36058f046f79880fc995ab441a1446bf8cbda709-200x251-png","_type":"reference"}},"image5":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-1dd5ef2ece61540719769dd66d59009211f173e7-800x1004-png","_type":"reference"}},"image6":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-552b1d663325c5ba46b6b226a6f769ab2e8728df-200x251-png","_type":"reference"}},"text1":"OUR VISION: ETHICALLY PROTECTING COMMON DEMOCRATIC VALUES","text2":"As a company founded in democratic countries and on democratic values, we have a special duty to approach the development and deployment of advanced defence systems, such as strike drones, with particular responsibility and thoughtfulness.\n\nWe believe in the principle that a human needs to be in or on the loop for all critical decisions; and we know that enforcing this principle requires conviction and technological leadership, especially in the face of adversaries taking shortcuts.\n\nOur internal processes allow all company staff to co-create, contribute to and critically challenge our ethical decision process. This is true both for technological topics as well as questions around deployment and acceptable customer nations.\n\nWe have been committed to these principles since the founding of Helsing, and we are further deepening their application with HX-2."},"slide2":{"text1":"PRECISE \nMASS","text2":null},"slide3":{"bgImageLandscape":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-819300813283caaedac4ae3b1801cb644d8c32f0-4320x2700-png","_type":"reference"}},"bgImagePortrait":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-977c0de78798730211d17ad15efcfe3a24700cba-390x844-png","_type":"reference"}},"text1":"SOFTWARE-DEFINED","text2":"EW-IMMUNE","text3":"MASS-PRODUCABLE","text4":"HX-2 is a new type of strike drone: software-defined and mass-producible. HX-2 is capable of engaging artillery, armoured and other military targets at beyond-line-of-sight range (up to 100km).\n\nOnboard artificial intelligence ensures that HX-2 is immune to hostile electronic warfare (EW) measures through its ability to search for, re-identify and engage targets even without a signal or a continuous data connection.â€¨\n\nA human operator stays in or on the loop for all critical decisions."},"slide4":{"videoLandscape":{"360":"a19ce6498e374dc418501f2a794078335969d433.mp4","720":"a19ce6498e374dc418501f2a794078335969d433.mp4","1080":"a19ce6498e374dc418501f2a794078335969d433.mp4"},"videoPortrait":{"360":"5a1a88888fce0e07969f688ffada618e0c658f27.mp4","720":"5a1a88888fce0e07969f688ffada618e0c658f27.mp4","1080":"5a1a88888fce0e07969f688ffada618e0c658f27.mp4"}},"slide5":{"bgImageLandscape":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-451c513beda4bf1b43ee965fbfea5c6f80fa694b-4320x2700-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"bgImagePortrait":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-2b70354fd16742cda3d697a46de67a9c62cddabb-1170x2532-jpg","_type":"reference"}},"text1":{"growsUp":true,"posX":66,"posY":26.5,"text":"Over-the-air software updates to dynamically adapt to new threats and tactics","width":22},"text2":{"growsUp":true,"posX":31.8,"posY":32,"text":"Onboard AI for robust mission execution in denied environments","width":23},"text3":{"growsUp":false,"posX":73,"posY":55,"text":"Networked with Altra software platform for coordinated swarm strikes","width":20},"text4":{"growsUp":true,"posX":8.2,"posY":55.5,"text":"Multiple payload options including armour-penetrating shaped charge","width":24}},"slide6":{"bgImageLandscape":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-28f2b0eb066432d029cca5d1654cac5eef493c00-2880x1800-png","_type":"reference"}},"bgImagePortrait":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-42d26fead9eb9f1deed545d0cdc297ff9bd830d7-780x844-png","_type":"reference"}},"text1":"Swarm-capable through Altra ","text2":"HX-2 is integrated into Altra, Helsingâ€™s reconnaissance-strike software platform that enables the seamless operation of multiple HX-2 systems, intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (ISR) assets, artillery systems and battlefield management software, delivering a scalable, battle-winning system of systems."},"slide7":{"bulletPoints":[{"_key":"ef3d702610f3","_type":"bulletPointNumber","label":"Range up to","number":100,"unit":"km"},{"_key":"0ffe59c9f717","_type":"bulletPointNumber","label":"Weight","number":12,"unit":"kg"},{"_key":"147e954eede8","_type":"bulletPointNumber","label":"Max Speed","number":220,"unit":"km/h"},{"_key":"00b3c98c7e4c","_type":"bulletPointText","label":"Payload","text":"Multi-purpose\nAnti-tank\nAnti-structure munition"}],"vector":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-4ccc4a7aadcf30bf1162f9d22f5e12889bcc1d2a-523x525-svg","_type":"reference"}}},"slide8":{"text1":"Missing translation","text2":"Missing translation","text3":"Missing translation"},"slide9":{"text1":"Missing translation","text2":"Missing translation"}}}]
